            "reviewBody": "yum yum",
            "datePublished": "2015-03-21T15:34:14.533Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jillian"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Just as the submittrt states, \"it's quick, easy, and healthy\" - perfect for a light lunch! Like others, I toasted the bagel first. Since I didn't have radishes on hand I used thin sliced English cucumber instead. Perfect with a tall glass of iced tea!",
            "datePublished": "2015-03-21T09:30:09.687Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "collegechef08"
            },
            "reviewBody": "A great sandwich for a light lunch, I did toast the bagel but otherwise followed the recipe. The radishes are especially good here. Thanks for sharing!",
            "datePublished": "2012-05-08T16:38:40.383Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jennifer Baker"
            },
            "reviewBody": "My daughter asked for these for her lunchbox, which means it's a winner! We grow our own radishes and arugula, and will have our own tomatoes later this Summer, so this is a perfect way to use our garden for a quick and healthy meal. We prefer the thin bagels over regular, and pictured is a whole wheat version. The cream cheese mixture has a subtle but savory flavor, and combined with the spiciness of the radishes and arugula, it's a definite treat. I'll make these often when my garden grows! Thanks!",
            "datePublished": "2012-05-06T17:31:08.657Z"
          },
